  "added_scope": "Adds the actual mapped constant ROM (8x cbuf_g_tp8 + crom_gr TP8, released masks) on SU ca/cq and the six real TP8 slab masters (qfd_port_tiles_b/_b_f1, 384 mapped scale-ROM macros qslab_b*_h*_g*_c*_b*) on TT c0..2/f0..2. ME-array block words (bw), tree words (ty), result serialisation to VM rb and token start/position remain explicit external inputs. join961 adds three static band result serialisers qfd_res_ser_static (pt_b.rq -> vm.rb_b, tt.mer_b engine enable), replacing the credit-based qfd_sp_res_ser for the static rule."
